      "short_description": "Modern, open-air amphitheater on the Garden State Parkway featuring covered stadium seating and an expansive lawn for large-scale concerts and summer tours.",
      "number_of_stations": null,
      "cuisine_description": null,
      "overall_description": "The PNC Bank Arts Center is a prominent open-air amphitheater located in Holmdel, New Jersey, known for hosting major musical acts and summer concert tours. The venue features a combination of reserved stadium seating and an open lawn, set within a lush, forested environment that provides a unique nature-focused experience. Visitors frequently engage in pre-show tailgating in the extensive parking lots, adding a social and communal element to the concert-going experience. With its blend of natural scenery and professional production, it serves as a central destination for live entertainment in the region.",
      "service_description": null,
      "ambience_description": "The venue offers a relaxed and social atmosphere, often centered around a lively tailgating culture before performances. During concerts, the mood is energetic and celebratory, with fans enjoying the outdoor, festival-like setting.",
      "amenities_description": "The venue provides standard concert amenities including food and drink concessions, bars, and public restrooms. It also offers convenience services such as chair rentals, bag check-in, water refill stations, and a mix of paid and free parking options.",
      "unique_selling_points": "This venue is uniquely known for its expansive lawn area and long-standing tradition of concert tailgating in the parking lots. It stands out for providing a rare combination of large-scale concert production and a natural, open-air park environment.",
      "neighborhood_description": "The venue is located in a secluded area surrounded by greenery, providing a peaceful, natural environment away from urban congestion.",
      "physical_setting_description": "Situated along the Garden State Parkway, this open-air amphitheater is nestled within lush, wooded surroundings. It features a blend of covered stadium seating and a spacious grassy lawn area.",
      "customer_demographics_description": null,
